{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic tower defense meets roguelike adventure where you control the hero! Dive into procedurally generated levels filled with unique waves of enemies. Create powerful synergies with a variety of game-changing skills, relics, weapons, and traits to defend your kingdom. Every run is a new challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build and upgrade your defenses!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place your defenses to hold the line against relentless enemy waves. Command 54 unique towers, each with its own strengths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/GIF_build_mortar_level_1_2_3.gif?t=1744144372\" />Upgrade and evolve your build!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your hero and towers wisely! Earn rewards from waves, shop for crucial upgrades, and forge a winning strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/GIF_update_skills.gif?t=1744144372\" />Adapt to procedurally generated maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maps and enemy waves are procedurally generated every run. No memorization needed, just strategy and real-time adaptation!.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/GIF_maps_generation.gif?t=1744144372\" />Unleash your creativity with unique builds and combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional tower defense games, Rogue Kingdoms lets you fully control a hero. Auto-attack, dodge, cast powerful skills, and create powerful Hero-Tower-Summon synergies to break the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/GIF_Hero_builds.gif?t=1744144372\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose next destination based on map layout, rewards and curses!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Information is key. We provide all the information you need to make strategic choices. Plan your upgrades and outsmart the hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/maps.gif?t=1744144372\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More than 250 relics, skills, skill upgrades, traits and weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover powerful upgrades that reshape every run, ensuring fresh and exciting gameplay every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/collection_def.gif?t=1744144372\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Drac Blau Studio</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re Anna (2D artist) and Alex (gameplay developer), a small but passionate couple working part-time on Rogue Kingdoms. Our game wouldn\u2019t be possible without the incredible support of playtesters, friends, the game doctor, and the community\u2014thank you for shaping this adventure with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/GIF_newsletter.gif?t=1744144372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/Imagen_anuncio_Steam_600x200.png?t=1744144372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Kingdoms is a game inspired by classic tower defense games such as Kingdom Rush saga or Bloons TD6, combined with modern roguelike elements such as Ember knights, Thronefall, Rogue Tower, Emberward, Vampire Survivors, Soulstone Survivors, Brotato or Gnomes.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defeat Dark Archer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/ed3977cbd25235d21e948266de16c845033401e3.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Dark Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/ac3975f9bf84533b3f5c368b32d11620fa6f240e.jpg"},{"name":"Max Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/9113f1f954e799d923593668a967cc54a45ccadf.jpg"},{"name":"Summoner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/889db36f830d06370d23d72c3fdfadecc65bb77a.jpg"},{"name":"Bare Bones Defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/eaa791df40bfd017d748351940066ad9b5adb3ca.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/8c7b8849c9499a47a88166a08cef3b008a82bf13.jpg"},{"name":"A Painful Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/f1b6dac370ab1f41fc0dd05e19c94126d1a3c99e.jpg"},{"name":"Mastery Initiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/dfa93abd9dd52e5cbf029de0283b753c58166fe8.jpg"},{"name":"Mastery Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/2e4b14fae5aa1d403fb41947dfb782554832bf9a.jpg"},{"name":"Peak Performance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692930/ec0fda1d3c218021445afbc0ec8c8deda459b58e.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2692930?t=1744144372","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/1fe5179f80b275a048c8aab0e5bd3ae054db2940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744144372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/a485de7fa12320a974ae403418b76a958a74e479/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744144372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/a485de7fa12320a974ae403418b76a958a74e479/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744144372","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic tower defense meets roguelike adventure where you control the hero! Dive into procedurally generated levels filled with unique waves of enemies. Create powerful synergies with a variety of game-changing skills, relics, weapons, and traits to defend your kingdom. Every run is a new challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build and upgrade your defenses!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place your defenses to hold the line against relentless enemy waves. Command 54 unique towers, each with its own strengths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/GIF_build_mortar_level_1_2_3.gif?t=1744144372\" />Upgrade and evolve your build!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your hero and towers wisely! Earn rewards from waves, shop for crucial upgrades, and forge a winning strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/GIF_update_skills.gif?t=1744144372\" />Adapt to procedurally generated maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maps and enemy waves are procedurally generated every run. No memorization needed, just strategy and real-time adaptation!.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692930/extras/GIF_maps_generation.gif?t=1744144372\" />Unleash your creativity with unique builds and combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragr